DESCRIPTION:1. Wake slowly + water (3 min) - Open the blinds\, drink a gla
 ss of water\, 5 slow breaths.\n2. Gentle movement (10 min) - 10-min gentle
  flow: neck and shoulder rolls\, cat-cow\, hip circles\, slow squats\, sta
 nding forward fold\, 5 slow breaths.\n3. Shower + get ready (7 min) - Warm
  shower\, dress in what you laid out.\n4. Calm breakfast (8 min) - Pick fr
 om your breakfast plan. No phone while you eat if you can.\n5. One intenti
 on (2 min) - One word or line for the day. Then go.\n\nDefault start: 6:00
